19	/// S3-compatible media storage backed by RustFS (or any S3 endpoint).
20	///
21	/// Pipeline: decode -> strip EXIF -> resize (long-edge, preserve aspect)
22	/// -> encode WebP q80 -> PUT with immutable cache headers.
